── SYNTAX ERROR ────────────────────────────── E0100_python_not.lt:1:37  [E0100]

Stilt writes `!`, not `not`:

  1 │ fn closed(open: bool) -> bool { not open }
    │                                     ^^^^

`&&`, `||` and `!` work on `bool`s.

To fix it, write `!`:

  1 │ fn closed(open: bool) -> bool { !open }
    │                                 ~
